## Why This Is Asked
This tests a beginner's ability to orchestrate data setup, mock external services, and verify security-sensitive flows end-to-end.

## Key Concepts
- End-to-end test with authentication flows
- Data seeding and teardown isolation
- External service mocking (email gateway) for determinism

## Code Example
```javascript
// Playwright outline
test('2FA on first login', async ({ page, request }) => {
  // seed user, signup flow, capture 2FA code, complete signup
  // logout, login with remember device, verify no 2FA prompt
});
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you adapt this for rate-limiting or retry on email delivery?
- How would you reuse this test for different environments (dev/stage/prod) without code changes?

